# Palani's Hatcher ("At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control one or more Eggs, sacrifice an Egg, then create a 3/3 green
# Dinosaur creature token" - an intervening if, CR 603.4). Turn 1: Hatcher makes two Egg tokens and the first combat sacrifices one. Turn 2:
# Bot2 casts Rukh Egg, an Egg Bot1 does not control. Turn 3: Bot1 casts its own Rukh Egg, a card, not a token; with both kinds of Egg in
# play it sacrifices the Rukh Egg, which dies and brings a 4/4 Bird at the next end step (CR 701.21a, 603.10a), leaving the token. Turn 5:
# the Egg token is sacrificed too. Turn 7: Bot1 controls no Egg (Bot2's Rukh Egg does not count), the condition fails and no
# Dinosaur is made. CR 603.4, 701.21a, 111.1.

